Subject: [PATCH] kernel: fix Cirrus HDA dependency for 7.4

The Linux 7.4 Cirrus HDA codec driver uses the scodec component
module, so select its 7.4 package dependency.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/sound.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/sound.mk
@@ -550,1 +550,1 @@
-  $(call AddDepends/sound,kmod-sound-hda-core +LINUX_7_3:kmod-snd-hda-scodec-component)
+  $(call AddDepends/sound,kmod-sound-hda-core +LINUX_7_4:kmod-snd-hda-scodec-component)
